{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":false,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"spades-game UI copy.fields.rulesText","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"spades-game.copy.fields.rulesText","keys":["spades-game.copy.fields.rulesText"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"An raba kwalin katin ZXQPH0000QXZ na gabaɗaya daidai. Duk mai wasa yana ba da zarge-zarge na ZXQPH0001QXZ–ZXQPH0002QXZ; zarge-zarge mai nasara da babu komai zai samu ZXQPH0003QXZ kuma zarge-zarge da babu komai zai rasa ZXQPH0004QXZ. Yarjejeniyar ƙungiya na ƙara su ba da zarge-zarge da babu komai: sanya adadin duka na ZXQPH0005QXZ na maki a kowace zarge, da kuma wani jakar don kowace zarge mai yawa; kada ka manta da shi kuma ka rasa ZXQPH0006QXZ na maki a kowace zarge. Duk jakar da aka tara ta ɗari tana rage ZXQPH0007QXZ na maki. 'Yan wasa dole su bi tufafin da aka shirya idan za'a iya. Ba za'a iya shirya spades ba sai an karya su sai idan mai wasa yana da spades","record_id":"0b7b82654fbed2b474a7b6468ded2265cd689562478e92686b7526fbfb2e3f4a","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":5.814206522625,"source":"The standard 52-card deck is dealt evenly. Each player bids 0–13 tricks; a successful nil bid scores 100 and a failed nil loses 100. Team contracts add their non-nil bids: make the total for 10 points per bid, plus one bag for each extra trick; miss it and lose 10 points per bid. Every ten accumulated bags subtract 100 points. Players must follow the suit led when possible. Spades cannot be led until broken unless a player holds only spades, and a spade beats any non-spade card.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"b070b3bdbe8ea9a514fbc13b545bd851619f9a66b846fe5b4b157ec211a4c86c","status":"needs-review","translation":"An raba kwalin katin 52 na gabaɗaya daidai. Duk mai wasa yana ba da zarge-zarge na 0–13; zarge-zarge mai nasara da babu komai zai samu 100 kuma zarge-zarge da babu komai zai rasa 100. Yarjejeniyar ƙungiya na ƙara su ba da zarge-zarge da babu komai: sanya adadin duka na 10 na maki a kowace zarge, da kuma wani jakar don kowace zarge mai yawa; kada ka manta da shi kuma ka rasa 10 na maki a kowace zarge. Duk jakar da aka tara ta ɗari tana rage 100 na maki. 'Yan wasa dole su bi tufafin da aka shirya idan za'a iya. Ba za'a iya shirya spades ba sai an karya su sai idan mai wasa yana da spades","truncated":true,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
